Tau Architecture
Copyright (c) 2026 Ian Griffiths

A balanced-ternary processor over the Eisenstein (60-degree hex) integer
lattice, with a Lean formalization, RTL, and a binary RISC-V SoC that uses
ternary only where it wins (transport and hex addressing).

Third-party components (PicoRV32, NEORV32) are licensed under their own terms;
see THIRD_PARTY.md.
